<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L1" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">restart:

A:=u1(x,  t2)^2*alpha+(alpha*v1(x,  t2)+v1(x,  t2))*u1(x,  t2)+v1(x,  t2)^2+u2(x,  t2)+v2(x,  t2)+(diff(u2(x,  t2), x, x))/Lc^2+(diff(u2(x,  t2),  y))/Lc^2:

B:=(diff(u2(x, t[2]), x, x))/l[c]^2+u1(x, t[2])*v1(x, t[2])*(1+alpha)+v2(x, t[2])+u2(x, t[2])+u1(x, t[2])^2*alpha+v1(x, t[2])^2:

simplify(subs({k=Pi,ax=a,t2=t[2],Lc=l[c]},A-B));</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L2" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
