<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">A:=[Ux = ((6*alpha-3)*dv+(4*alpha-2)*gv+2*gvv)*ax(t2)^2/(9*dv+6*gv), Uy = Uy, Vx = ((-6*alpha+3)*dv+(-4*alpha+2)*gv+4*gvv)*ax(t2)^2/(18*dv+12*gv), Vy = Vy, Uxy = Uxy, Vxy = Vxy, Uc = (dv*(-2*alpha+1)+(4*alpha-2)*gv+2*gvv)*ax(t2)^2/(dv-2*gv), Vc = ((2*alpha-1)*dv+(-4*alpha+2)*gv-4*gvv)*ax(t2)^2/(2*dv-4*gv)];

